<title>GERMANY: German Q2 cocoa grind due July 7/8 - industry assn.</title>
<headline>German Q2 cocoa grind due July 7/8 - industry assn.</headline>
<dateline>BONN 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Germany's cocoa grind figure for the second quarter of 1997 will probably be ready for release on July 7 or 8, the confectionery industry association BDS said on Friday.</p>
<p>The data, a key pointer to chocolate demand, showed an 11.71 percent year-on-year fall in the first quarter to 61,379.3 tonnes.</p>
<p>--Hamburg newsroom, +49-40-41903275</p>
</text>
